Rosey locale files live here, one JSON file per language listed under
`languages` in /rosey.yml.

Created by `npm run rosey:sync` and kept in sync with ../base.json by
`rosey-cloudcannon-connector write-locales` on every build. Editors translate
them inline in CloudCannon's Visual Editor, or through the Translations
collection.

Removing a language from rosey.yml archives its file into ../locales-disabled/
rather than deleting it, so the translations survive and come back if the
language is re-enabled.
